        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Cluster 1 was prepared by a solvothermal reaction of 4-tert-butylbenzoic acid (Htbba), 4-azidobenzoic acid (Hpaza), Eu(OAc)3·4H2O and Ti(OiPr)4. The converted main text prints the charges as Htbba (0.43 mmol, 7 mg), Hpaza (0.063 mmol, 10 mg), Eu(OAc)3·4H2O (0.055 mmol, 18 mg) and Ti(OiPr)4 (0.06 mmol, 18 mL); temperature, time and the full procedure are referred to the Supporting Information and were not supplied here. Bulk purity was checked by PXRD against the single-crystal structure. The crystal contains the [Eu8Ti10(μ3-O)14]36+ core, 30 tbba, 4 paza, 2 acetate, coordinated THF, and CH3CN and water; weathering leaves only 8 H2O and 4 THF in the powder sample. The deposited formula C370H436Eu8N12O92Ti10·4THF·7MeCN·9H2O matches the core ligand count and the reported MeCN.",
